REM Mobile Mouse & Permission Interaction
REM Demonstrates moving cursor and tapping on screen buttons (like Allow / OK)

DELAY 2000

REM Open Chrome via Mobile Search
GUI SPACE
DELAY 800
STRING Chrome
ENTER
DELAY 1500

REM Move cursor towards center-lower area where permission dialogs pop up
MOUSE_MOVE 0 150
DELAY 300

REM Attempt Tab navigation to focus 'Allow' or 'OK' button
TAB
DELAY 200
TAB
DELAY 200
ENTER

REM Fallback: click with mouse cursor directly
MOUSE_CLICK LEFT
